    <p class="sub reveal">A brand isn't a colour palette. Yours is probably three fonts and a feeling. Here is what it should be instead.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta reveal"><span>16 Min Read</span><span class="b"></span><span>Updated 2026</span><span class="b"></span><span>The Digital Income Edit™ Editorial</span></div>
